title: "Biometric identification using BCI systems"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB implementation of an EEG-based biometric identification system that
  recognizes individuals from functional-connectivity patterns (PLV, PLI, COR,
  AEC, AECc, COH) across five frequency bands, evaluated with Equal Error Rate.
